module std;

import core;

// Forge hosted standard library bootstrap.
//
// `std` is layered on `core`. Hosted startup, I/O, filesystem, networking,
// clocks, OS threads, entropy, and process allocator policy will live here as
// their platform contracts are defined.
//
// No fake print/allocator intrinsics are declared yet: the runtime ABI and
// foreign/platform binding mechanism should be specified before std exposes them.